  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Manajemen Grup: Add & Edit",
      "id": "add-edit",
      "intro": "Melalui Add & Edit Drawer (panel drawer geser sisi kanan berukuran 560px), Anda dapat membuat grup penerima baru atau memperbarui informasi grup yang sudah ada. Form ini hanya membutuhkan dua data inti: Group Name dan Platform komunikasi yang akan digunakan oleh seluruh anggota grup.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Drawer Add / Edit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tambah Grup (Add):** Klik tombol **Add Group** di toolbar kanan atas untuk membuka panel drawer *Create Contact Group*.\n• **Ubah Grup (Edit):** Klik salah satu grup di daftar untuk membuka Detail Panel, lalu klik tombol **Edit Group** di sidebar panel kiri.\n• Judul panel drawer akan menyesuaikan secara dinamis menjadi **Create Contact Group** atau **Edit Contact Group** beserta badge deskriptor status `Add` atau `Edit`.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Contact Group</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">● Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">Group Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Group name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">Enter group name</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Platform <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\">Choose platform <span>▼</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#7c3aed;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;opacity:0.5;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Mengisi Field & Validasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nIsi parameter berikut dengan benar:\n1. **Group name** *(wajib)*: Nama unik untuk mengidentifikasi grup penerima (contoh: `Risk Team Alpha`, `Ops Supervisor`).\n2. **Platform** *(wajib)*: Saluran komunikasi yang akan digunakan oleh seluruh anggota grup. Pilih dari dropdown dengan ikon identifikasi:\n   - **Email** — ikon surat (📧)\n   - **Telegram** — ikon pesawat kertas (✈)\n   - **WhatsApp** — ikon chat (💬)\n• Tombol **Create** (atau **Update** jika mengedit) akan aktif setelah semua field tervalidasi lengkap.\n• Klik **Cancel** untuk menutup drawer tanpa menyimpan perubahan.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Group name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">Risk Team Alpha</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Platform <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;justify-content:space-between;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg>Email</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">▼</span></div><div style=\"background:#fafaf8;border-top:1px solid #e9d5ff;padding:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#f3f0ff;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"/></svg>Email</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z\"/><path d=\"M22 2 11 13\"/></svg>Telegram</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg>WhatsApp</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#7c3aed;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(124,58,237,.35);\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
